{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261122/photo/bkn-20261122135510188-1122_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261122190329\"/><p>現場為西九龍中心。（馬竟峯攝）</p><p>深水埗有人在扶手梯上跌倒。今午(22日)1時42分，一名姓黃(62歲)婦人使用欽州街37K號西九龍中心一條下行扶手梯時，懷疑失平衡跌倒，其頭部紅腫，當場陷入昏迷。救援人員趕往現場，將事主送院治理，她其後回復清醒。警員正調查事件經過及原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T11:24:01.852732+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T05:55:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T11:37:14.478617+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T11:17:15.963993+00:00","content_hash":"aaf0e423dd2f8a523b62d27d2accec61d05afbd78f3a7d44ae662aac40a8ce7c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T11:24:01.852732+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}